# TAG: Gm7 | C7 | F6/9 held two bars.
# Same climb as B2 bar 1 and the C7 bar, then the final chord voiced wide from the bottom up:
# F1 bass, F2 bari, A3 trombone, G4 tenor, D5+A5 trumpets, so the 6th and 9th sit on top and ring like a big-band button.
pattern tag
tpt   | .- Bb4+F4 D5+G4 F5+Bb4- G5+D5- .- F5+Bb4 D5+G4 .- F5+Bb4- | G5+C5------- .- E5+Bb4- F5+Bb4 E5+Bb4 C5+G4- | A5+D5---------------! | -------- .------- |
tenor | .- D4 F4 G4- Bb4- .- G4 F4 .- G4- | Bb4------- .- G4- G4 G4 E4- | G4--------------- | -------- .------- |
bone  | .- G3 Bb3 D4- F4- .- D4 Bb3 .- D4- | E4------- .- C4- C4 C4 Bb3- | A3--------------- | -------- .------- |
bari  | .- G2 Bb2 D3- G2- .- D3 Bb2 .- G2- | C3------- .- G2- A2 Bb2 C3- | F2--------------- | -------- .------- |
bass  | G2-- G2 .- D3- G2-- Bb2 D3- C3 B2 | C3-- C3 .- G2- C3-- Bb2 G2- E2 C2 | F1--------------- | -------- .------- |
gtr   | .--- D4+F4+Bb4 .-- .--- D4+F4+Bb4 . D4+F4+Bb4 . | .--- E4+G4+Bb4 .-- .--- E4+G4+Bb4 . E4+G4+Bb4 . | A3+D4+G4--------------- | -------- .------- |
piano | F3+Bb3+D4- .- F3+Bb3+D4- .- F3+Bb3+D4- .- F3+Bb3+D4- .- | E3+G3+Bb3- .- E3+G3+Bb3- .- E3+G3+Bb3- .- E3+G3+Bb3- .- | F2+C3+G3+A3+D4--------------- | -------- .------- |
organ | F4+Bb4+D5--------------- | E4+Bb4+D5--------------- | A3+D4+G4+C5--------------- | -------- .------- |
kick  | x... ..x. x... ..x. | x... ..x. x... .... | X... .... .... .... | _ |
snare | x... X... x... X... | x... X... ..o. XoXX | X... .... .... .... | _ |
hat   | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | % | _ | _ |
tamb  | x.x. X.x. x.x. X.x. | % | X... .... .... .... | _ |
